WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:06.080
This... This Right Here is the Girl Band Generation!

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.000
G'morning!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Hey.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.000
What's wrong?

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.170
Oh, uh...

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:23.580
I was thinking about when you
found your guitar, right over there...

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.750
Although, I was convinced you were
a burglar at the time...

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.960
Oh yeah! "Put your hands up!"

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.040
Th-that was 'cause...

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:33.750
Wha-?

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.670
Cut it out!

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.460
Today's the big day, huh?

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:44.170
We've been through a lot...

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:47.540
Three Weeks Live,
and working on your study guides...

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.080
Making the PoPi-V, too.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.210
The warehouse show?

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:51.210
And our self-sponsored show.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.790
What a blast!

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.330
Everyone sparkled like crazy!

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.580
You never quit, do you?

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:01.630
At first, I thought you were an airhead
with a complete lack of common sense...

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.630
But without you,
none of this would've ever happened.

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:06.750
Arisa...?

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:10.170
Fear can, like, stop you from trying new things...

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.330
No one knows what the future holds,

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:16.290
but when you face your fears,
something exciting is waiting on the other side.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:19.380
I'm glad PoPiPa exists.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:21.710
Me, too!

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:22.710
Morning!

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:23.830
Oh, g'morning!

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:24.580
Hey.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:26.080
So much for the snow, huh?

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.210
I wanted to build a snow-band...

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:29.380
A snow-band!

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.420
What the heck is that?

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:32.790
We're all here!

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:33.630
Yup.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:42.580
Well then, shall we head to the Budokan?

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:43.880
Yeah!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.630
That was fast!

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:46.830
It's only three stops away.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.540
So close, yet so far...

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.330
Sums it up pretty well...

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:50.290
PoPiPa!
Sums it up pretty well...

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.170
PoPiPa!

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:52.710
Good morning, everyone!

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:53.540
Good morning!
Good morning, everyone!

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:53.920
Good morning!
G'morning!

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:54.250
G'morning!

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:55.000
Hey, Rock.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.460
Here's hoping for a great show!

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:57.460
Morning!

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:00.000
You're yawning?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.130
No way! You aren't nervous?

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:03.420
Of course!

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.960
A monster lives inside of the Budokan.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.580
It'll gobble us up the moment it
senses fear, you know.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:09.670
A monster?!

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:10.380
What?!

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:14.130
Big talk from someone so
high-strung yesterday, don'tcha think?

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.790
She was so worried about the finals
that she nearly drowned in the tub.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:18.630
LAYER!

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.500
Luckily I came to the rescue in the nick of time!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.380
PAREO!

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:22.580
You got her to take a bath?

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.380
Yes!

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:26.040
The tub at CHU2-san's house is REALLY big.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:28.540
It might even be bigger than
the one at the bathhouse...

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:29.790
Nah, not even close.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.790
The five of us took a bath together
to melt away CHU2-sama's stress!

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.500
I'm going ahead!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.920
Wait for me, CHU2-sama!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:36.830
Shall we?
Wait for me, CHU2-sama!

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:37.790
Sure!
Wait for me, CHU2-sama!

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.000
We should get going, too!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.170
Yeah!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.210
Onward!

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:42.920
Wait up!

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:44.380
Hey, slow down!

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.080
Sorry, guys! We're running short on time.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.830
Let's check the lighting and effects.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:51.290
It's huge...
Let's check the lighting and effects.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:52.330
Awesome!
'Kay!

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.960
It really IS round...
Once more from the top. Sound good?

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.540
Once more from the top. Sound good?

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:56.790
'Kay!

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:01.500
Can you raise the brightness on
the spotlights a little more?

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.670
Sure! Gimme one sec.

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:06.670
How's that?

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:07.960
Perfect, thank you.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:14.290
Tonight, the almighty Roselia
shall descend upon the Promised Land!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.960
You're excited for the concert, aren't you?

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:16.750
Yup!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.580
Rin-Rin, our costumes are going to look SO COOL!

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:21.040
Okay, switch places.
They're my favorite!

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:22.790
Yukina

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.040
Thanks for your help.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.000
Anytime.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.420
Thanks, CHU2.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:25.630
You're welcome.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:29.170
You're up next, RAS!
Please make your way to the stage!

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:31.710
It's as big as I remember...

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.080
You certainly seem comfy.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:34.920
Sure am.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:37.290
Good idea, King! I'll join you!

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.250
Doesn't the floor hurt your back?

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.080
Nope, it feels nice and cool.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.000
C'mon, Rin-Rin!

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:42.630
Huh?!

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:43.460
And you, Rokka!

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:44.130
What?!

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.500
Rehearsal's starting, you know!

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.040
Just give us a minute.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.250
Beg your pardon.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.750
It's so big!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.040
Wow, you weren't kidding...

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:52.670
Right?

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.960
Jeez, Masuki...
You're always lying down everywhere.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.330
You oughtta try it.
You barely slept last night, right?

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.290
What?

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:00.080
Excuse me!

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:01.290
You too, PAREO?!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.130
Join us, CHU2-sama!

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.790
No, thank you.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:09.250
Aww! A view like this doesn't come along
every day, CHU2-sama!

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.210
C'mon, CHOO-CHOO!

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.880
Don't say my name all weird!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.830
Can you give it a try, Masuki-chan?

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:17.880
Sure thing.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:20.460
Sayo...
Thank you!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.040
Thank you!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.040
Keep playing for me, please.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.580
Almost time for the concert, huh?
'Kay.

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:26.710
Imai-san...

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.790
Are the nerves finally setting in?

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.750
Yes. I'm feeling somewhat uneasy.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.250
I was convinced we were wasting our time...

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.080
Huh?

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:36.670
However...

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:41.540
Every single stage Roselia stands on
is meaningful in some way.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:46.040
One by one, we're going to conquer all of them.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:48.290
You bet!

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.920
Let's go out there and show 'em what we're made of!

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:51.750
Right.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:55.040
Alright, PoPiPa! You're up next!

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.040
'Kay!

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.580
We're so close to the audience!

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.710
It's packed full of seats...

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.080
Oh no, I'm sweating like crazy!

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.580
Don't forget to remember the different landmarks.

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.920
We can't see each other from here...

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.170
Hey, guys! C'mere real quick!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.040
What's the matter?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.290
Assemble!

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.710
Sit down!

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.040
This is the middle!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.420
The middle of the universe...

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.130
And?

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.380
What was the point of this?!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.000
Rimi?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.040
Are you alright?

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:31.130
Oh, sorry! I kind of zoned out...

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.830
We'll have a chocolate cornet together later.

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:33.500
Okay...

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.710
There's no time for goofing off, PoPiPa!

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:36.830
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.420
We need to concentrate.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.420
This is the REALLY real deal!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.210
Once we step onto this platform,
we'll be onstage at the Budokan.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:08.580
Oh, my gosh...!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:09.750
Wanna play a word game?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:10.830
What for?!

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.460
You're up, PoPiPa.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:13.330
Right!

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:24.880
I... don't want to go.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:30.210
It's just... Every day was a blast...

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:33.670
All of the shows we put on after school...

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:36.540
Meeting in the warehouse and practicing...

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:40.460
It might've been tough,
but we were always together...

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:46.040
The second we stand on that stage,
everything comes to an end...

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:47.630
Rimi-rin...

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:48.920
Rimi...

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.830
It's time, PoPiPa.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:54.000
Rimi-rin!

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.000
Going up!

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.420
Let's do our chant!

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:11.420
NOW?!

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:12.250
Yup!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.630
Here we go!

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.170
Po-Pi-Pa! Pi-Po-Pa!

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.540
Po-Pi-Pa-Pa-Pi-Po-Pa!

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.670
They actually know it...

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.210
They learned our chant.

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:32.790
No way...!

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.710
All aboard the wave!

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:50.960
This song is our way of saying
thank you for your support.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.000
I hope we can sparkle and tingle together!

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:58.670
"Mirai Train"!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.920
Thank you very much!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.170
LOCK... You really love PoPiPa, don't you?

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:02.580
WITH ALL MY HEART!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.210
The PoPiPa girls are cute and bubbly, and they have
the power to enrapture an entire stadium with-

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:05.330
There she goes...
The PoPiPa girls are cute and bubbly, and they have
the power to enrapture an entire stadium with-

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.630
The PoPiPa girls are cute and bubbly, and they have
the power to enrapture an entire stadium with-

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:07.960
Time to go, LOCK!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.040
Masuki-san?!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.250
Let's huddle up!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:11.830
Huh?

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.460
Oh, how exciting!

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.130
Wh-what?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.830
We're doing the chant, aren't we?

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.500
CHU2-sama...!

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:24.880
C'mon, Rei!

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:25.960
Me?!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:27.670
Who else would do it?

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:28.460
Exactly!

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:29.750
We're counting on you.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:32.500
Let's do this OUR way!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.170
Yeah!

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:37.880
RAS! RAS! RAS!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.460
On bass and vocals:

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:49.790
LAYER!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.790
On guitar:

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.250
LOCK!

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:57.290
On drums:

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:58.880
MASKING!

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:01.540
On keyboard:

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:02.880
PAREO!

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:04.540
PAREO!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:06.960
And our DJ:

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.500
CHU2!

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:10.710
We are...

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:12.880
RAISE A SUILEN!

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:16.170
For your listening pleasure...

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.290
"Beautiful Birthday."

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.000
Incredible...

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.500
They really are amazing...

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:06.670
What a lovely song.

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:07.750
Not bad!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:10.330
Rokka and King and
everyone else were awesome!

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.250
It's our turn.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:20.290
Give them a show they'll never forget.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:52.920
We are Roselia.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:57.790
By participating in this tournament,
we've discovered something precious.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.460
And for that, we'd like to express our gratitude.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.040
"Avant-garde HISTORY."

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.420
Roselia sure is cool, don'tcha think?

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.790
Of course...

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.670
The polls are open!

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:12.790
Please select one of the three bands competing
here tonight and cast your votes via the app.

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.250
Rimi?

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:19.500
Rimi-rin?!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:25.250
The concert was SO MUCH FUN!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.830
Thank you...

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.420
Thank YOU, Rimi-rin!

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.210
Huh?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:33.540
Thanks for always being there to back us up.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:34.750
Thanks!

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:36.080
Saaya-chan...

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.290
O-Tae-chan...

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:39.080
Wouldn't mind performing here again.

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.880
Let's put on a BUNCH of shows together!

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:44.670
We'll play forever and ever!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:48.170
There's us, and Roselia, and RAS...

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:52.130
Afterglow, PasuPare, Hello Happy,
CHiSPA, and Guri-Guri!

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:54.130
Everyone we've met along the way,

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:57.000
and everyone we could possibly meet in the future!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:59.710
Let's sparkle and tingle like there's no tomorrow!

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:01.460
She gave the same speech this morning.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.130
Arisa!

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:06.880
Ladies and gentlemen,
the polls are officially closed.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.880
Thank you for your patience
during the voting process.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:15.790
And now, it's time to announce the results of
the "BanG Dream! Girls Band Challenge."

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:18.040
Please welcome our special guest!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.000
It's the owner!

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.000
Owner!

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.420
Shisen from Miraska...

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:30.500
No way! It's really her!

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:34.080
You've shown me quite the performance.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.630
Each of you...

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.380
did a fantastic job.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.920
Now then, allow me to announce the results.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:47.290
The grand prize goes to...

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.250
Roselia!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.880
We did it! We did it, Sayo!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.500
Yes...

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.830
Hooray! Rin-Rin!

00:17:58.830 --> 00:17:59.580
Ako-chan!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.630
Yukina!

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:04.500
Yukina-san!
Lisa!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:05.330
Yukina-san!
Ako!

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:17.000
Next, the prize for "Best Performance" goes to...

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.000
RAISE A SUILEN.

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:21.460
Prize for "Best Performance"...?

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:22.750
What's that supposed to mean?

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.630
And the prize for "Best Band" goes to...

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:25.920
Poppin' Party.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.080
Us, too?!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.290
What's going on here?

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.460
The best band won "Best Band"!

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:32.290
Huh...?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.880
PoPiPa!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:37.540
All of you put on a great show.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:54.290
This... this right here...

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:57.460
is the Girl Band Generation!

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:00.130
Well, shall we?

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.330
